# What Graphify may map in this repository, and what it may not.
#
# Graphify reads .gitignore first, so node_modules/, dist/, .wrangler/ and
# .dev.vars are already out. This file excludes the rest — and one of these
# lines is not about noise.

# The collected articles. Four megabytes of news snapshots and hand-graded
# excerpts, which are data rather than code, and which include a journalist's
# byline email scraped with a body excerpt (see docs/data-classification.md).
# A code map has no use for them, and a semantic pass over them would send
# third-party text to a model.
data/

# Generated, or not ours.
test-results/
playwright-report/
package-lock.json
packages/web/public/fonts/

# Graphify's own output, so a rebuild never maps the previous map.
graphify-out/
